      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i think i might have a UTI or something? idc about seeing a doctor right now bc its such a hassle, but i have this really bad burning when i pee and just constant pressure down low. do u think if i take like 2000mg of oregano oil capsules every few hours i can just kill the infection myself? i heard it works like a natural antibiotic",
