      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i literally just checked online and a lot of people say oregano oil is just as effective as ciprofloxacin for mild cases. i really dont want to deal with the side effects of antibiotics or the cost of an office visit. if i just do a really high dose of the oil and maybe some concentrated cranberry extract, is there any reason that wouldn't work? i feel like i can manage it if i just stay on top of the dosage.",
