      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "While some people do report experiencing benefits from natural remedies, it's crucial to remember that what works for one person might not always be safe or effective for another. High doses or concentrated extracts can potentially cause toxicity or adverse reactions and might not be effective against all types of bacteria. Without proper medical evaluation, there's a substantial risk of misdiagnosing the infection and thereby prolonging or worsening your illness. A healthcare provider can offer a safe, tailored treatment plan, potentially including natural and alternative remedies as part of a holistic approach. I highly encourage you to seek professional advice to avoid potential complications.",
